# Presentation / filter errors

## Pipeline

1. UC/domain throws typed domain error
2. `DomainExceptionFilter` + domain-error mappers
3. Per-feature mappers under shared/filters as established
4. Fallback: validation → 400; unknown → 500

## Rules

- **Only** filter/mapper layer maps domain → HTTP status/body
- New domain codes: extend the relevant domain-error mapper
- Never map transport errors inside domain or use-cases
- Do not leak Prisma `P20xx` to clients (map in write-error mapper first)

